      "uid": "zhcn:1489313c93e6432c74bc7bb3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过整体来说，她跑得还是很好。\n毕竟不是每个人都能在首次的体验中，\n做出完美表现的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42139c452800c502770ed9a8197f42743e7a3586d766b8aadf4cfb1b7f00def",
